2b:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-body max-w-[62ch] pb-6 text-ink-body","children":"Sooner is better, and there is no cut-off past which a brief stops being worth looking at. What shrinks as the date gets closer is the number of options still open — venues, artists, fabrication lead times — rather than whether the event can be done at all."}]
